#: src/Abilities/Abilities/CreateRefund.php:30
msgid "Issue a refund against a SureCart charge. Requires the charge ID, refund amount in the smallest currency unit (e.g., cents for USD), and a reason code (duplicate, fraudulent, requested_by_customer, expired_uncaptured_charge). Refunds are only supported for charges processed through a real payment processor (Stripe, PayPal, etc.) — the action initiates an irreversible financial transaction that returns money to the customer's payment method. Charges paid via a manual payment method (e.g., bank transfer, e-Transfer, cash) cannot be refunded through SureCart; any reimbursement for those must be handled offline and tracked outside the system."
msgstr "Terbitkan pengembalian dana atas tagihan SureCart. Memerlukan ID tagihan, jumlah pengembalian dana dalam satuan mata uang terkecil (mis., sen untuk USD), dan kode alasan (duplicate, fraudulent, requested_by_customer, expired_uncaptured_charge). Pengembalian dana hanya didukung untuk tagihan yang diproses melalui prosesor pembayaran sungguhan (Stripe, PayPal, dll.) — tindakan ini memulai transaksi keuangan yang tidak dapat dibatalkan dan mengembalikan uang ke metode pembayaran pelanggan. Tagihan yang dibayar melalui metode pembayaran manual (mis., transfer bank, e-Transfer, tunai) tidak dapat dikembalikan dananya melalui SureCart; penggantian dana untuk tagihan tersebut harus ditangani secara offline dan dicatat di luar sistem."

#: src/Abilities/Abilities/CreateRefund.php:23
msgid "Create Refund"
msgstr "Buat Pengembalian Dana"

